{"seq":1,"slug":"autoregressive-tts","title":"自回归语音合成模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-synthesis/models/autoregressive-tts","wordCount":1223,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"自回归语音合成模型\">自回归语音合成模型</h1><p>2023 年初微软发布 VALL-E，将 TTS 重新定义为条件语言建模问题：给定文本 token 和短暂的说话人提示，自回归地预测语音 codec token 序列。这一简洁范式在 VALL-E 2（2024）上达到了人类同等水平的 MOS 4.2——首次证明零样本 TTS 可以与真人录音难分伯仲。本文深入剖析自回归 TTS 的设计空间、关键技术突破和代表模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>自回归 TTS</strong>：把语音 codec token 视为另一种「语言」，用 next-token prediction 目标建模 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\mathbf{y} | \\mathbf{x}, \\mathbf{s})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，逐 token 生成语音</li>\n<li><strong>条件建模</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{x}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 为文本 token，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 为说话人提示的 codec token，目标序列 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{y}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 在前缀条件下生成</li>\n<li><strong>两阶段生成</strong>：AR 阶段生成 RVQ 第 1 层（语义 + 说话人身份），NAR 阶段并行预测第 2-8 层（声学细节）</li>\n<li><strong>词重复问题</strong>：自回归解码容易陷入循环，是原始 VALL-E 的主要缺陷（WER 5.2%），VALL-E 2 用 RAS 缓解</li>\n<li><strong>规模效应</strong>：数据从数百小时扩到百万小时、参数从 300M 扩到 8B，质量与零样本能力随之涌现</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"从语言建模视角理解-tts\">从语言建模视角理解 TTS</h2><p>自回归 TTS 的核心洞察：语音 codec token 就是另一种「语言」，可以用标准的 next-token prediction 训练目标来学习。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\mathbf{y} | \\mathbf{x}, \\mathbf{s}) = \\prod_{t=1}^{T} P(y_t | y_{&lt;t}, \\mathbf{x}, \\mathbf{s})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0954em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1774em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{x}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 是文本 token 序列，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 是说话人提示的 codec token（3-10 秒参考音频编码），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{y}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 是目标语音 codec token 序列。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[文本 Token] --&gt; C[Transformer Decoder&lt;br/&gt;AR 逐步生成]&#10;    B[说话人提示&lt;br/&gt;3s codec token] --&gt; C&#10;    C --&gt; D[第 1 层 Codec Token]&#10;    D --&gt; E[NAR 模型&lt;br/&gt;并行预测 2-8 层]&#10;    E --&gt; F[完整 RVQ Token]&#10;    F --&gt; G[Codec Decoder&lt;br/&gt;重建波形]\">flowchart LR\n    A[文本 Token] --&gt; C[Transformer Decoder&lt;br/&gt;AR 逐步生成]\n    B[说话人提示&lt;br/&gt;3s codec token] --&gt; C\n    C --&gt; D[第 1 层 Codec Token]\n    D --&gt; E[NAR 模型&lt;br/&gt;并行预测 2-8 层]\n    E --&gt; F[完整 RVQ Token]\n    F --&gt; G[Codec Decoder&lt;br/&gt;重建波形]</pre><h2 id=\"vall-e-奠基之作\">VALL-E：奠基之作</h2><p>VALL-E（2023.01）在 LibriLight 60,000 小时英语语音上训练，架构设计的关键决策：</p>\n<p><strong>两阶段生成</strong>：AR 阶段自回归生成 RVQ 第 1 层 token（携带粗粒度语义和说话人身份），NAR 阶段给定第 1 层并行预测第 2-8 层（声学细节）。</p>\n<p><strong>条件编码</strong>：文本输入经 phoneme 化后与说话人提示 token 拼接作为前缀，AR 模型在此前缀条件下生成。</p>\n<p><strong>局限</strong>：原始 VALL-E 存在严重的词重复问题——自回归解码时模型容易陷入循环。WER 高达 5.2%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"vall-e-2-达到人类同等水平\">VALL-E 2：达到人类同等水平</h2><p>VALL-E 2（2024.06）通过两项关键创新解决了前代的稳定性问题：</p>\n<p><strong>Grouped Code Modeling</strong>：将 codec token 按时间分组，组内并行预测、组间自回归。既缩短了序列长度，又保持了时序因果性。</p>\n<p><strong>Repetition-Aware Sampling (RAS)</strong>：在解码过程中实时监控 token 重复模式。当检测到连续重复的 token 组时，动态降低其采样概率，强制模型选择不同续写路径。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>VALL-E</th>\n<th>VALL-E 2</th>\n<th>人类录音</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自然度 MOS</td>\n<td>3.8</td>\n<td>4.2</td>\n<td>4.3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>说话人相似度 MOS</td>\n<td>3.5</td>\n<td>3.9</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WER (%)</td>\n<td>5.2</td>\n<td>2.3</td>\n<td>1.9</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>训练数据</td>\n<td>60K h</td>\n<td>50K h</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>VALL-E 2 是首个在 LibriSpeech test-clean 上达到人类同等水平的零样本 TTS 模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"fish-audio-s1-s2\">Fish Audio S1 / S2</h2><p><strong>Fish Speech 1.5（S1，2024-2025）</strong>：基于 LLaMA 架构的 decoder-only Transformer，VQGAN 声码器替代传统 EnCodec，无需 phoneme 化直接从文本 BPE token 生成，支持 13 种语言混合输入。</p>\n<p><strong>Fish Audio S2（2026.03）</strong>：引入自然语言指令控制（通过文字描述控制情感、语速、说话风格）、多说话人多轮对话原生支持、GRPO 多奖励 RL 对齐（语义准确性 + 声学质量 + 说话人相似度）、基于 SGLang 的流式推理引擎（RTF 0.195，首包延迟 &lt;100ms）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"关键设计选择的权衡\">关键设计选择的权衡</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设计轴</th>\n<th>选项 A</th>\n<th>选项 B</th>\n<th>代表模型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>文本表示</td>\n<td>Phoneme</td>\n<td>BPE/字符</td>\n<td>VALL-E (phoneme) vs Fish Speech (BPE)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RVQ 生成策略</td>\n<td>AR+NAR 分离</td>\n<td>交错生成</td>\n<td>VALL-E vs CosyVoice</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>训练目标</td>\n<td>纯 NLL</td>\n<td>NLL + RL</td>\n<td>Fish S1 vs Fish S2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>声学解码</td>\n<td>Codec decoder</td>\n<td>Flow Matching</td>\n<td>VALL-E vs SeedTTS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型规模</td>\n<td>300M-1B</td>\n<td>3B-8B</td>\n<td>Fish S2 vs Inworld TTS 1.5 (8B)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"规模定律在-tts-中的体现\">规模定律在 TTS 中的体现</h2><p>自回归 TTS 模型也展现出类似 LLM 的规模效应：数据规模从数百小时扩展到 6 万小时再到百万小时，每次数量级跨越都带来可测量的质量提升；模型规模从 300M（VALL-E）到 1.5B（Fish S2）到 8B（Inworld TTS 1.5 Max），参数量增长伴随更强的零样本和情感控制能力。当训练数据足够大时，模型自发学会情感表达、语气控制、代码切换等能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>自回归 TTS 将语音生成等价为 next-token prediction</li>\n<li>VALL-E 2 通过 Repetition-Aware Sampling 首次达到人类同等 MOS</li>\n<li>Fish Audio S2 引入自然语言指令控制和 RL 对齐</li>\n<li>SeedTTS/CosyVoice 用 Flow Matching 替代 NAR 阶段提升音质</li>\n<li>模型规模从 300M 扩展到 8B，呈现类 LLM 的涌现能力</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"non-autoregressive-tts\">非自回归与混合模型</a> —— AR 的互补范式：并行生成的速度优势</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../nlp-transformers/pretraining/pretraining-objectives\">预训练目标</a> —— 理解 next-token prediction 的理论根基</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自回归语音合成模型","id":"自回归语音合成模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从语言建模视角理解 TTS","id":"从语言建模视角理解-tts"},{"level":2,"text":"VALL-E：奠基之作","id":"vall-e-奠基之作"},{"level":2,"text":"VALL-E 2：达到人类同等水平","id":"vall-e-2-达到人类同等水平"},{"level":2,"text":"Fish Audio S1 / S2","id":"fish-audio-s1-s2"},{"level":2,"text":"关键设计选择的权衡","id":"关键设计选择的权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"规模定律在 TTS 中的体现","id":"规模定律在-tts-中的体现"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"神经音频编解码器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-synthesis/foundations/neural-audio-codecs"},"next":{"title":"非自回归与混合语音合成模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-synthesis/models/non-autoregressive-tts"}}